{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“Grothendieck–Riemann–Roch 定理”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Grothendieck--Riemann--Roch定理"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Grothendieck–Riemann–Roch 定理描述了"},{"Local":{"url":"陈特征","text":"陈特征"}},{"Plain":"沿着"},{"Local":{"url":"紧合映射","text":"紧合映射"}},{"Plain":" (proper map) $f\\colon X\\to Y$ 的前推与自然性的差距, 其 “矫正项” 与 "},{"Local":{"url":"Todd类","text":"Todd 类"}},{"Plain":"有关, 仅取决于 $X$ 和 $Y$ 本身.</p>\n<p>这个定理可视为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Hirzebruch--Riemann--Roch定理","text":"Hirzebruch–Riemann–Roch 定理"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"相对","text":"相对"}},{"Plain":"版本.</p>\n<p>设 $f\\colon X\\to Y$ 是光滑代数簇的"},{"Local":{"url":"紧合映射","text":"紧合映射"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>令 $K(X)$ 为 $X$ 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"凝聚层","text":"凝聚层"}},{"Plain":"或局部自由层的 Grothendieck 环 (见 "},{"Local":{"url":"K-理论","text":"K-理论"}},{"Plain":"), 定义同态 $f_k\\colon K(X)\\to K(Y)$ 为态射 $f$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"导出前推","text":"导出前推"}},{"Plain":"的交错和\n$$\r\nf_k(F):=\\sum (-1)^q R^q f_* F.\r\n$$\n<span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grothendieck%E2%80%93Riemann%E2%80%93Roch_theorem\" title=\"Wiki [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grothendieck%E2%80%93Riemann%E2%80%93Roch_theorem]\">Wiki</a></span> 叙述的定理考虑的是 $f_!=\\sum (-1)^i R^i f_*\\colon K_0(X)\\to K_0(Y)$, 其中 $K_0(X)$ 是凝聚层的有界复形的 Grothendieck 群.</p>\n<p>考虑"},{"Local":{"url":"周环","text":"周环"}},{"Plain":"的推出映射 $f_*\\colon A(X)\\to A(Y)$.</p>\n<p><strong>定理</strong> (Grothendieck) 对任意 $\\alpha\\in K(X)$,\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{ch}(f_k\\alpha) \\operatorname{td}(T_Y) = f_*(\\operatorname{ch}(\\alpha)\\operatorname{td}(T_X)).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Euler示性数","text":"Euler 示性数"}},{"Plain":" $\\chi(X,F)$ 可用"},{"Local":{"url":"陈特征","text":"陈特征"}},{"Plain":"表示. 当 $Y$ 是一个点时,\n$$\r\n\\chi(X,F)= \\operatorname{ch}\\Big(\\sum (-1)^q H^q(X,F)\\Big).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}